From: Project Luma <builds@project-luma.local>
Subject: [PATCH] luma: Quick Options menus size their rows to what they hold

Every row in a Quick Options detail menu was forced to 30px. Anything
richer than one line of text overflowed it: Tiling's layout grid painted
over Edit Layouts, Display 2 and Tiling Settings so none of them could be
clicked, and device and network rows put the icon below its name with
blank space around the separator. Rows now take the height of their
content, separators keep a small margin, secured and open networks line
up, detail menus keep the grid's gap below them, and the keyboard
backlight levels use the Quick Options control styling.

--- a/data/theme/gnome-shell-dark.css
+++ b/data/theme/gnome-shell-dark.css
@@ -4098,7 +4098,7 @@
   color: #969da4; }
 
 .quick-toggle-menu.luma-quick-detail {
-  margin: 0;
+  margin: 0 0 10px;
   padding: 9px;
   border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.075);
   border-radius: 10px;
@@ -4119,10 +4119,35 @@
     color: #969da4; }
   .quick-toggle-menu.luma-quick-detail .popup-menu-item {
     min-height: 0;
-    height: 30px;
-    padding: 6px 10px;
+    padding: 10px;
+    spacing: 10px;
     border-radius: 10px;
     font-size: 13px; }
+  .quick-toggle-menu.luma-quick-detail .popup-separator-menu-item {
+    padding: 4px 10px; }
+  .quick-toggle-menu.luma-quick-detail .nm-network-item .wireless-secure-icon {
+    width: 7px; }
+  .quick-toggle-menu.luma-quick-detail .device-subtitle {
+    color: #969da4; }
+  .quick-toggle-menu.luma-quick-detail .keyboard-brightness-level {
+    spacing: 6px; }
+    .quick-toggle-menu.luma-quick-detail .keyboard-brightness-level .button {
+      height: 36px;
+      min-height: 0;
+      padding: 0;
+      border-radius: 10px;
+      background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.072);
+      color: #e9ebec; }
+      .quick-toggle-menu.luma-quick-detail .keyboard-brightness-level .button StIcon {
+        icon-size: 16px; }
+      .quick-toggle-menu.luma-quick-detail .keyboard-brightness-level .button:hover {
+        background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12); }
+      .quick-toggle-menu.luma-quick-detail .keyboard-brightness-level .button:checked {
+        background-color: #e6e9eb;
+        color: #242a30; }
+    .quick-toggle-menu.luma-quick-detail .keyboard-brightness-level StLabel {
+      font-size: 12px;
+      color: #969da4; }
 /* Luma notification-owned rules; safe to compile without the global Shell SCSS. */
 .notification-banner {
   min-height: 64px;
